      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok thats a start but youre still being a bit vague. \"economic dynamism\" and \"political feasibility\" are just buzzwords. i need the actual logic gaps. like, how exactly does their reliance on high taxation create a death spiral for innovation? give me the specific, concrete arguments that prove their model is fundamentally broken, not just \"contested.\"",
